From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SableOS <noreply@sableos.invalid>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 15:30:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SableOS: per-app check boxes on the Sable apps step

Under Full Sable, Essentials and Stock Android the step lists the
Recommended and Optional Sable apps the phone has, one check box each
(Core apps are not listed). First time, the boxes show the chosen set's
defaults; revisited, they show what is on now; picking another set puts
that set's defaults back. Next applies the set, then the boxes: a ticked
app is turned on, an unticked one off, and an unticked app turns on its
installed LineageOS counterpart. Nothing is uninstalled.

The Essentials text now names the Core apps and Camera.

Pure policy: SableAppSet.customizable() and plan(choice, installed,
wanted).
---
